{"id":67591,"date":"2026-05-05T21:50:44","date_gmt":"2026-05-05T20:50:44","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=67591"},"modified":"2026-09-27T22:51:57","modified_gmt":"2026-09-27T21:51:57","slug":"corrida-a-c-s","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-a-c-s\/","title":{"rendered":"XXXI Corrida do RG3 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">XXXI Corrida do RG3 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>XXXI Corrida do RG3 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>26 de Setembro de 2026<\/strong>, com partida e chegada no emblem\u00e1tico <strong>Regimento de Guarni\u00e7\u00e3o N.\u00ba 3 (RG3)<\/strong>, na cidade do Funchal, Ilha da Madeira. A prova pontua para o prestigiado circuito regional Madeira a Correr da \u00e9poca desportiva.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa competitivo inclui a <strong>prova principal de 5,5 km<\/strong> em circuito urbano de estrada (destinada a juniores, seniores e veteranos), complementada pelas <strong>corridas jovens de 2 km e 1 km<\/strong> disputadas inteiramente no interior do complexo militar do RG3, fomentando o atletismo de forma\u00e7\u00e3o na regi\u00e3o aut\u00f3noma.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o conjunta est\u00e1 a cargo do <strong>Regimento de Guarni\u00e7\u00e3o N.\u00ba 3 e da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo da Regi\u00e3o Aut\u00f3noma da Madeira (AARAM)<\/strong>, garantindo policiamento, cobertura m\u00e9dica de primeiros socorros, seguro desportivo integral e cronometragem oficial eletr\u00f3nica por chip.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">26 de Setembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Regimento de Guarni\u00e7\u00e3o N.\u00ba 3 (RG3), Funchal, Madeira<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Estrada 5.5 km, Jovens 2 km e Benjamins\/Infantis 1 km<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">AARAM \/ Regimento de Guarni\u00e7\u00e3o N.\u00ba 3<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">1h15<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/atletismodamadeira.pt\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/E26-49_Corrida-RG3-1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><br \/>\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Abrir Regulamento Oficial (PDF) &rarr;<br \/><\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Estrada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida Principal 5,5 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 26 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 17:00 \u2022 65m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Filiados AARAM:<\/strong> 0.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (sem inscri\u00e7\u00e3o pr\u00e9via)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">N\u00e3o Filiados (fpacompeticoes):<\/strong> Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Gratuita<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 23\/09)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Jovem<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida Sub-16 e Sub-18 (2 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 26 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 17:50<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Jovens:<\/strong> 0.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 23\/09)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Infantil<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida Sub-14 (1 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 26 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 17:45<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Infantil:<\/strong> 0.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 23\/09)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a XXXI Corrida do RG3 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 26 de Setembro de 2026, com partidas em frente \u00e0 Porta D&#8217;armas do Regimento de Guarni\u00e7\u00e3o N.\u00ba 3 (RG3), no Funchal, Ilha da Madeira.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e hor\u00e1rios do evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A corrida principal de 5,5 km parte \u00e0s 17h00. As provas jovens realizam-se a partir das 17h45 (1 km para sub-14) e 17h50 (2 km para sub-16 e sub-18).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como se inscrevem os atletas filiados e n\u00e3o filiados?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os atletas com filia\u00e7\u00e3o na AARAM e dorsal com chip apenas necessitam de comparecer na partida. Os atletas n\u00e3o filiados devem inscrever-se online em fpacompeticoes.pt at\u00e9 23 de setembro.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial da corrida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O regulamento oficial em formato PDF da AARAM est\u00e1 dispon\u00edvel para consulta e download direto na ficha t\u00e9cnica do evento no portal Portugal Running.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde s\u00e3o entregues os dorsais e chips aos n\u00e3o filiados?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os dorsais e chips dos atletas n\u00e3o filiados s\u00e3o levantados na sede da AARAM, no Funchal, entre os dias 24 e 25 de setembro durante o hor\u00e1rio de expediente.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"XXXI Corrida do RG3 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-09-26\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Funchal, Madeira\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Funchal\", \"addressRegion\": \"Madeira\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza a XXXI Corrida do RG3 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 26 de Setembro de 2026, com partidas em frente \u00e0 Porta D\u2019armas do Regimento de Guarni\u00e7\u00e3o N.\u00ba 3 (RG3), no Funchal, Ilha da Madeira.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e hor\u00e1rios do evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A corrida principal de 5,5 km parte \u00e0s 17h00. As provas jovens realizam-se a partir das 17h45 (1 km para sub-14) e 17h50 (2 km para sub-16 e sub-18).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como se inscrevem os atletas filiados e n\u00e3o filiados?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Os atletas com filia\u00e7\u00e3o na AARAM e dorsal com chip apenas necessitam de comparecer na partida. Os atletas n\u00e3o filiados devem inscrever-se online em fpacompeticoes.pt at\u00e9 23 de setembro.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial da corrida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O regulamento oficial em formato PDF da AARAM est\u00e1 dispon\u00edvel para consulta e download direto na ficha t\u00e9cnica do evento no portal Portugal Running.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde s\u00e3o entregues os dorsais e chips aos n\u00e3o filiados?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Os dorsais e chips dos atletas n\u00e3o filiados s\u00e3o levantados na sede da AARAM, no Funchal, entre os dias 24 e 25 de setembro durante o hor\u00e1rio de expediente.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":67875,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,478,624],"event_type_2":[36,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4"